1
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:52,330
Chu Qingyun,

2
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:54,240
My Lady, you are...

3
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:54,880
It's me,

4
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:55,700
Xue Keying,

5
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:57,000
the Second Miss of the Duke
of Ying's Mansion,

6
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,200
Xue Ruowan's sister.

7
00:00:58,960 --> 00:00:59,920
As far as I know,

8
00:01:00,200 --> 00:01:01,560
the Duke of Ying only has one daughter

9
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,560
named Xue Ruowan.

10
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,970
I have never heard of

11
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:05,170
her having a sister.

12
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:23,680
How could this be?

13
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:26,940
There is no such person as Xue Keying.

14
00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,480
Then who am I?

15
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:30,970
Don't block our General's way.

16
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:39,720
Ning Yuanci!

17
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,600
I'm so glad you're alive.

18
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:43,460
How audacious!

19
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,860
How dare you call our General by his name!

20
00:01:46,479 --> 00:01:48,210
Don't you recognize me either?

21
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:50,400
Cui Hu!

22
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,800
Tonight's engagement banquet
is very important.

23
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:54,400
There can't be any mistakes.

24
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,560
Throw all irrelevant people

25
00:01:55,560 --> 00:01:56,400
out.

26
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:57,130
Yes, sir.

27
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,039
Move.

28
00:01:58,280 --> 00:01:58,759
Stop!

29
00:01:58,840 --> 00:01:59,440
Let her go.

30
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:03,760
General Ning,

31
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,890
Judging by her clothes,

32
00:02:06,160 --> 00:02:07,720
she should be a maid of our family.

33
00:02:07,720 --> 00:02:10,039
I hope the General won't
make things difficult for her.

34
00:02:10,039 --> 00:02:10,900
In that case...

35
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:12,960
I shall grant Miss Xue this favor.

36
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,090
Thank you, General.

37
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:20,290
Let's go.

38
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,930
Tonight, Xue Shiyan

39
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,840
will poison Xue Ruowan.

40
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,000
But without Xue Keying,

41
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,120
who can save her?

42
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:36,320
No.

43
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:40,120
I must stop this.

44
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,940
I will make Ning Yuanci

45
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,780
see Xue Shiyan's true colors.

46
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,760
This is Miss Xue's favorite.

47
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:52,170
Remember to serve it to the main table.

48
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:52,760
Okay.

49
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,280
Give this to me.

50
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:57,730
Okay.

51
00:02:59,320 --> 00:03:00,040
Xiaofu.

52
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:01,440
Xiaofu.

53
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:03,040
So I do have a name.

54
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,160
Didn't you already

55
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:05,040
give me the medicine?

56
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,570
What do you want me to do now?

57
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:07,680
Medicine?

58
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:08,620
What medicine?

59
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:14,160
She'll only get a little sick
if she eats it.

60
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:15,280
When the time comes, insist

61
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:16,610
that Ning Yuanci did it.

62
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,690
Don't forget

63
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:18,960
who holds

64
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,730
the lives of your whole family.

65
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,160
Be a good girl.

66
00:03:24,760 --> 00:03:25,760
Where is the medicine I gave you?

67
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:26,320
You didn't already

68
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:27,980
give it to Xue Ruowan, did you?

69
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:35,760
If

70
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,760
Xue Ruowan takes this medicine,

71
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,760
it won't just be a minor illness.

72
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:41,250
She will die.

73
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:42,200
How could the Duke poison

74
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:43,520
his own daughter?

75
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:44,840
It's all Xue Shiyan's

76
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:46,040
deceptive rhetoric.

77
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:48,000
If you believe Xue Shiyan,

78
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:50,610
he will have leverage over you,

79
00:03:50,640 --> 00:03:52,000
and there will be no turning back.

80
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,200
Then what should I do?

81
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:53,760
How can I

82
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,200
protect my lady?

83
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,000
Although we are not

84
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,730
the protagonists of the story,

85
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:02,680
we are not

86
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,210
puppets to be manipulated.

87
00:04:04,720 --> 00:04:06,080
As long as we truly live,

88
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,280
we should become

89
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,360
who we want to be.

90
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:13,240
Wan'er said she was going out
for some fresh air.

91
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:14,840
Why hasn't she returned yet?

92
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:20,290
General,

93
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,760
we found an assassin.

94
00:04:21,839 --> 00:04:23,500
We await your orders, My Lord.

95
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,760
Didn't you say

96
00:04:30,760 --> 00:04:31,960
you had something urgent to tell me?

97
00:04:31,960 --> 00:04:32,840
What is it?

98
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:37,720
What?

99
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:39,000
Who told you that?

100
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:40,159
There is no time to explain.

101
00:04:40,159 --> 00:04:40,720
Young Master Chu

102
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,000
will be waiting for you
outside Jinming Pool.

103
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,460
My Lady,

104
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:43,320
you should leave the city with him

105
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:44,159
tonight.

106
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,159
This maid turned herself in.

107
00:04:48,159 --> 00:04:49,800
You said you are a spy
for the Duke of Ying

108
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,600
and know where the evidence

109
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,600
of his treason is.

110
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,960
Why should I believe you?

111
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:59,120
In the Battle of Heishui River
five years ago,

112
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,440
your entire family was murdered

113
00:05:00,440 --> 00:05:01,480
because Xue Shiyan colluded

114
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,680
with Northern spies.

115
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,000
The secret code he used to communicate

116
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:04,840
with the spies

117
00:05:05,120 --> 00:05:06,200
was the deer totem.

118
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:08,650
Who exactly are you?

119
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,240
Where exactly is the evidence

120
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,440
of Xue Shiyan's crimes?

121
00:05:11,440 --> 00:05:12,240
I can tell you,

122
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,160
but you must let Xue Ruowan go

123
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:15,620
and guarantee her safety.

124
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,920
Do you think I want

125
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:23,490
to listen to your nonsense?

126
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,760
Do you think I won't kill you?

127
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:28,440
If you kill me,

128
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:30,480
you will get nothing.

129
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:32,880
Don't

130
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:34,320
you want

131
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:36,200
the murderer of your entire family

132
00:05:36,200 --> 00:05:37,280
to pay the price?

133
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:43,560
Men!

134
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,050
Pass on my orders

135
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,060
to search the entire city.

136
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:51,700
What happened?

137
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,280
Where is my daughter?

138
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,000
Northern assassins

139
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,610
have kidnapped Xue Ruowan.

140
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,930
I have ordered a city-wide search.

141
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:06,050
To prevent the assassins
from escaping in the chaos,

142
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:08,280
no one in Jinming Pool

143
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,480
is allowed to leave tonight.

144
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,440
What?

145
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,130
My daughter is missing!

146
00:06:15,280 --> 00:06:16,800
And you still want to trap me here?

147
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:17,720
Ning Yuanci!

148
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,280
What are you trying to do?

149
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:25,880
Ning Yuanci,

150
00:06:26,520 --> 00:06:28,040
you accuse me of treason.

151
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,360
Do you have any proof?

152
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:30,260
Don't be hasty.

153
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:32,330
The evidence will be here shortly.

154
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:40,370
General,

155
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,370
these were all found

156
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,000
in the Duke of Ying's storehouse.

157
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,240
These are the paintings

158
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,080
he used to pass intelligence to the spies.

159
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:49,880
The totem messages are hidden
beneath the canvas.

160
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:00,920
My father

161
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,960
treated you like a brother,

162
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,320
but you harbored resentment,

163
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:11,320
committing treason

164
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:14,100
just to wipe out my entire family.

165
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:18,440
You.

166
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:19,600
You.

167
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,960
The Xue family has held a noble title
for three generations.

168
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,360
I have served two emperors.

169
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,560
How dare you touch me?

170
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:30,800
I will not let you

171
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,840
die so easily.

172
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:33,480
I will chop off

173
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,080
all your hands,

174
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:40,720
stuff your body

175
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,880
into a tiny box,

176
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:47,480
and sink it into the sea.

177
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,560
She said I'm a spy.

178
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:52,840
I could also say

179
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:54,040
she was bribed by you.

180
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:56,520
I know her background better than you do.

181
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,880
I have plenty of ways to prove

182
00:07:57,880 --> 00:07:59,520
she belongs to your residence.

183
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,160
Her testimony is invalid.

184
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,840
Now that so much evidence

185
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:05,920
has been found in your residence,

186
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:06,920
even without her,

187
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,250
I can still convict you.

188
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:14,250
Ning Yuanci,

189
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:16,120
w-what are you doing?

190
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:17,320
Y-You

191
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,040
wouldn't dare kill her.

192
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,370
Are you feeling guilty?

193
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:25,360
You colluded

194
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:26,720
to frame me.

195
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:30,050
Her testimony is not credible.

196
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,240
Then my testimony

197
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:32,890
should be credible, right?

198
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,360
Xue Ruowan,

199
00:08:34,679 --> 00:08:35,480
didn't I ask Chu Qingyun

200
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:36,409
to take you away?

201
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,520
Why are you back?

202
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:41,780
Five years ago,

203
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,200
my mother found letters

204
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,060
between Xue Shiyan and the enemy.

205
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,960
She was dying at the time,

206
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,000
so she left me this painting.

207
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,280
I originally thought

208
00:08:51,280 --> 00:08:53,340
she just wanted to leave me a memento.

209
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:54,490
Until this painting

210
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:56,570
was accidentally roasted by fire,

211
00:08:56,680 --> 00:08:58,360
I found my mother's

212
00:08:58,400 --> 00:08:59,600
last words to me on it.

213
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:01,000
It recorded

214
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:03,300
the hiding places of all the letters.

215
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:05,120
The truth will be known

216
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:06,250
once investigated.

217
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:17,890
Let's go.

218
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:22,360
General Ning,

219
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,640
this is what the Xue family owes you.

220
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,360
From now on,

221
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,970
let's go our separate ways.

222
00:10:03,640 --> 00:10:04,480
This should

223
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:06,480
count as a happy ending, right?

224
00:10:09,600 --> 00:10:10,440
But why don't I

225
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:12,040
feel happy at all?

226
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,080
Ning

227
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:35,320
Yuanci!

228
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:25,680
Why am I

229
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,800
back here again?

230
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:31,320
Didn't we agree

231
00:11:31,800 --> 00:11:32,880
that you'd let me go back

232
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,210
after the happy ending?

233
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:35,720
Let me out!

234
00:11:36,160 --> 00:11:37,000
Xue Keying,

235
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,400
the actress Xia Yimo has returned

236
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:40,360
to her world.

237
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,440
And you must stay here

238
00:11:42,800 --> 00:11:43,960
to accept your fate.

239
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,040
An accident occurred

240
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:47,960
on the first day of shooting

241
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,280
the costume drama Moxiang.

242
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:50,320
Fans question the crew's

243
00:11:50,320 --> 00:11:51,840
inadequate first aid measures.

244
00:11:51,840 --> 00:11:53,360
Top actress acts like a diva on set.

245
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:55,320
Drowning and falling into a coma
caused the crew to shut down.

246
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,720
Rumor has it that Xia Yimo

247
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:58,220
pushed Sun Xiaofei first.

248
00:11:58,400 --> 00:11:59,720
She's so vicious.

249
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:01,000
Now she's tasting her own medicine.

250
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,040
Support recasting.

251
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:04,240
Xia Yimo was dissatisfied with playing
the second female lead in Mo Xiang,

252
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:06,080
so she jumped into the water
to threaten the crew.

253
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,080
It almost cost a life.

254
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,360
Am I not Xia Yimo?

255
00:12:08,520 --> 00:12:10,280
No, you are Xue Keying.

256
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,320
You are the character persona

257
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,120
created by the actress Xia Yimo.

258
00:12:14,240 --> 00:12:15,280
Whether Xia Yimo can

259
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:16,810
continue to play Xue Keying

260
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:18,520
determines whether you can

261
00:12:18,520 --> 00:12:20,380
return to the world of the script.

262
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:21,840
What?

263
00:12:21,960 --> 00:12:22,800
If Xia Yimo

264
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:24,380
stops playing Xue Keying,

265
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,880
you will disappear completely.
